  "question": {
    "text": "The line <math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow> </math> is a tangent to the parabola <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>y</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow> </math> at a point whose abscissa is <math> <mrow> <mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow> </math> then the ordered pair <math> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is",
