  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of parabola is&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />So, equation of tangent with slope <math> <mn>2</mn> </math> is<br /><math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac> <mn>2</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow> </math><br />Point of contact is&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow> </mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
